ras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.poster.avif?t=1759163502\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.webm?t=1759163502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/extras/41a0103334371856bc2b6785857157a0.mp4?t=1759163502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catherina, a young warrior, embarks on a desperate quest to challenge the Undead King, a tyrant who promises salvation through monstrous transformation. Armed with his sword and sorrow, Catherina must battle corrupted knights, traverse cursed lands, and confront the fading soul of a dying world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.poster.avif?t=1759163502\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.webm?t=1759163502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/extras/6088cda485f69d1ef8b0b0b49d5a9f1a.mp4?t=1759163502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Citizen Pain</i> captures the essence of traditional single-player experiences while offering a skill-based challenge that rewards mastery and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal first-person melee combat</strong> with multiple special weapons to discover and wield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious, dangerous world to explore</strong>: from ruined villages to ancient catacombs, caverns, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wide variety of enemies and end-of-level bosses</strong>, each with distinct fighting styles, strengths, and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic, atmospheric soundtrack</strong> with unique themes for each level and boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hauntingly beautiful world</strong> crafted with Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alessandro Capriolo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3752240","name":"Citizen Pain"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990220/095b2a5e6be61d272804d6ef6cf579e8b501bd84/header.jpg?t=1759163502","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990220/1659524662/599a9d8d84559ba77f215d63a97c343dae211029/1758746672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759163500","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990220/1659524662/599a9d8d84559ba77f215d63a97c343dae211029/1758746672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759163500","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990220/1659524662/599a9d8d84559ba77f215d63a97c343dae211029/1758746672/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759163500","id":257205678,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205678/movie480.mp4?t=1759163500","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205678/movie_max.mp4?t=1759163500"},"name":"Citizen Pain - Release Date Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205678/0684686281277b8924c271b7ba20bcc10a50b2b1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759163500","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205678/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759163500","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/